content.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/task-intelligence-for-itsm/create-incident-prediction-model.md","line":41},{"title":"Set up your incident prediction model","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/task-intelligence-for-itsm/set-up-model.md","line":49},{"title":"Models","target":"c_Models","line":55},{"title":"settings","target":"settings-mobile","line":61},{"title":"Train your model","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/task-intelligence-for-itsm/set-up-model.md","line":102},{"title":"Recommended Actions for ITSM in Service Operations Workspace","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/service-operations-workspace/recommended-actions-for-itsm-in-service-operations-workspace.md","line":149},{"title":"Assess your model","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/task-intelligence-for-itsm/set-up-model.md","line":179},{"title":"Recommended Actions for ITSM in Service Operations Workspace","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/service-operations-workspace/recommended-actions-for-itsm-in-service-operations-workspace.md","line":200},{"title":"Task Intelligence for ITSM","target":"c-itsm-task-intelligence","line":204},{"title":"Models","target":"c_Models","line":205},{"title":"Settings","target":"settings-mobile","line":206}],"metadata":{"title":"Set up your incident prediction model","description":"Use Task Intelligence for ITSM to set up your incident prediction model and train it with your data to make predictions. Access your model's performance results, set the prediction preferences and behavior, and deploy your model.Train your incident prediction model with data to predict the incident fields.Assess the results from the model training and view sample results for the predicted fields. Reviewing the results gives you a preview of how your model will perform after being deployed. Based on the sample results, select the prediction preference and behavior for each field.Deploy the incident prediction model to predict the incident field information.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/it-service-management/task-intelligence-for-itsm/set-up-model.html","release":"australia","product":"Task Intelligence for ITSM","classification":"task-intelligence-for-itsm","topic_type":"task","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":5,"breadcrumb":["Create an incident prediction model","Manage","Task Intelligence for ITSM","IT Service Management"],"tags":["#it-service-management","#task-intelligence","#routing","#ai","#itsm","#type-task"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/it-service-management/task-intelligence-for-itsm/set-up-model.md"},
